  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Rules:


    The player whose turn it is may pick a field to conquer and
    thereafter choose a car for the current race.  The available cars can be seen
    by opening the car table via the button on the bottom left of the screen (Only
    two randomly selected cars are available at the start of the game). Next, the
    opponent picks their car and the race is played in Re-Volt/RVGL.


    There
    are six white fields and three red fields. When a player selects a white field,
    the opponent may not use the same car as the player this round. When a red field
    is selected, both players can freely choose their cars from the car table.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: edd1e801fa7a5144682285bf9dc182db, type: 2}
